<title>USA: Sioux City hogs $1.00 higher - USDA.</title>
<headline>Sioux City hogs $1.00 higher - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SIOUX CITY 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were $1.00 higher thin test. Trade moderate. Top $59.50 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US 1-3   220-270 lbs     59.50</p>
<p>	   270-280 lbs     58.50-59.00</p>
<p>US 2-3   280-300 lbs     56.50-58.00</p>
<p>US 3-4   300-330 lbs     53.00-55.50</p>
<p>Sows:  Compared to last Wednesday, all weights steady to 0.50 higher. Top 49.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3   300-500 lbs     45.50</p>
<p>	   500-550 lbs     48.50</p>
<p>	   550-700 lbs     49.00</p>
</text>
